                      965,
                      609
                    ],
                    "transcription": "(2) $x_1+x_2=-\\frac{b}{a}=-\\frac{-2}{1}=2$\n$x_1x_2=\\frac{c}{a}=t-5$\n$\\because 2x_1=|x_2|-1$\n$\\therefore |x_2|=2x_1+1$\n①$x_2\\ge0$时\n$x_1+(2x_1+1)=2,\\ x_2=\\frac{5}{3},\\ x_1=\\frac{1}{3}$\n$\\therefore x_1x_2=\\frac{1}{3}\\times\\frac{5}{3}=\\frac{5}{9}$\n$\\therefore t-5=\\frac{5}{9}$\n$\\therefore t=\\frac{50}{9}$\n②$x_2<0$\n$x_1+(-2x_1-1)=2,\\ x_1=-3,\\ x_2=5$\n$\\because 5>0$\n$\\therefore$该情况舍去\n$\\therefore t=\\frac{50}{9}$",
                    "legible": true,
                    "content_kind": "handwriting",
